    "sections": {
        "description": "A clean, lightweight, multipurpose full-site-editing block theme for businesses, agencies, SaaS products, freelancers, portfolios and blogs. bBlocks pairs a professional neutral design system with three header styles, three footer styles, and a library of Core-block patterns — hero, about, features, services, team, testimonials, pricing, call-to-action, contact and blog sections — so you can assemble a business, agency or SaaS site without a page builder. Works entirely with WordPress Core blocks; the companion bBlocks plugin is completely optional and never required."
    },
